The legacy flowchart engine is independently written. The new compatibility
source layer translates Pele preprocessing, detection, YAML and entity handling.
Compatibility pie, quadrant, packet, radar, timeline, journey, flowchart parsing,
rich labels, fallback text metrics, URL handling and SVG primitives translate
the pinned upstream implementation; upstream MIT attribution applies to these ports.
Full parser, model and rendering parity remains under implementation.

Mermaid: https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
The legacy renderer supports a documented subset of Mermaid flowcharts.
The preparation corpus includes Mermaid documentation examples extracted by Pele.
